    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.surround\n\n### Description\n\nWhen recording a macro mini.surround doesnt seem to function\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.10.2\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Begin recording a macro `qq`\r\n2. Attempt to use mini.surround `sr[(`\r\n3. See broken output\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n_No response_\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nWhen recording a macro running `sr[(` will replace the character under the cursor with `(` instead of replacing the surrounding brackets with parentheses.",
